{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/services/layout,_N_T_/services/[slug]/layout,_N_T_/services/[slug]/page,_N_T_/services/business-growth-system"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/services/$d$slug/__PAGE__"],"prefetchHints":{"hints":64,"slots":{"children":{"hints":96,"slots":{"children":{"hints":96,"slots":{"children":{"hints":160,"slots":null}}}}}}},"routeCache":{"key":"/route-cache/APP_PAGE/e6e9967145347c46d06f7c18cbc7593f023a0f464c96986256200139a67eed49/$/services/business-growth-system","owner":{"kind":"APP_PAGE","sourceRoute":"/services/[slug]/page"},"isFallback":false}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/2cxb684axw7o7.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/3s6nzrbk-8mnv.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/19mx3mg6lkumu.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3g4px251sg85e.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2z-e6jheq0ftu.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-03rfayxv7ep_b.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3jnihsg-rcdh1.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/24z92xz7r4i_p.js\" async=\"\"></script><title>Business Growth System in Jackson, MS | The Sip Web Studio</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"A website, local search foundation, and customer inquiry workflow for Mississippi service businesses ready to organize their next stage of growth.\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://thesipwebstudio.com/services/business-growth-system\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Business Growth System | The Sip Web Studio\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"A website, local search foundation, and customer inquiry workflow for Mississippi service businesses ready to organize their next stage of growth.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://thesipwebstudio.com/services/business-growth-system\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"The Sip Web Studio | Jackson, MS Web Design\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Practical websites and business technology for Mississippi businesses.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://thesipwebstudio.com/social-card.png\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico?favicon.1xagt9q099n52.ico\" sizes=\"48x48\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/studio-icon.svg\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main-content\">Skip to content</a><header class=\"site-header\"><div class=\"wrap nav\"><a class=\"wordmark\" aria-label=\"The Sip Web Studio home\" href=\"/\">the sip<span>WEB STUDIO</span></a><nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"/services\">Services</a><a href=\"/#portfolio\">Work</a><a href=\"/#about\">About</a><a href=\"/#pricing\">Pricing</a><a class=\"nav-cta\" href=\"/#contact\">Free growth review ↗</a></nav></div></header><main id=\"main-content\"><section class=\"section wrap\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><span>/</span><a href=\"/services\">Services</a><span>/</span><span>Business Growth System</span></nav><div class=\"service-hero\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Business Growth System<!-- --> · Jackson, MS</p><h1>More than a website. A better way to handle inquiries.</h1><p class=\"lead\">A website, local search foundation, and customer inquiry workflow for Mississippi service businesses ready to organize their next stage of growth.</p><div class=\"actions\"><a class=\"button\" href=\"#service-contact\">Get a free business growth review ↗</a></div></div><aside class=\"service-price\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Your starting point</p><p class=\"price\">$2,750+</p><p>one-time project</p><p>Typically 3–5 weeks once content, account access, and approvals are ready.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"#included\">See what’s included ↓</a></aside></div><div class=\"case-grid\"><h2>Is this a good fit?</h2><p>For contractors, landscapers, roofers, pressure-washing companies, and other service businesses that need both a stronger presence and a practical way to manage inquiries.</p></div><div id=\"included\" class=\"case-grid\"><h2>What you get</h2><ul class=\"deliverables\"><li>Everything in Professional Presence, with up to 10 pages</li><li>Dedicated pages for your key services</li><li>Local SEO setup and eligible Google Business Profile optimization</li><li>Enhanced estimate request form</li><li>Automated customer acknowledgment and owner notifications</li><li>Basic lead tracking and conversion event tracking</li><li>Launch performance review and workflow training</li></ul></div><div class=\"case-grid\"><h2>In everyday terms</h2><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Illustrative example</p><p>A landscaper receives a request with the property area and service needed. The inquiry is logged, the owner gets a notification, and the customer receives an acknowledgment with the next step.</p></div></div><div class=\"case-grid\"><h2>A clear scope</h2><div><p>Messaging, CRM, hosting, and other software subscriptions are separate. This is a setup project; ongoing marketing, follow-up management, and support are available separately. Leads and rankings are not guaranteed.</p><p>Before work begins, you receive a written scope covering deliverables, account access, revisions, payment milestones, and support. You keep ownership of your domain and business accounts.</p></div></div><div class=\"case-grid\"><h2>A few good questions</h2><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>Is this advertising?</summary><p>No. This package improves your website and inquiry process. Paid ad campaigns and ad spend are not included.</p></details><details><summary>Can it work with my current CRM?</summary><p>We check your platform’s integration options before quoting. More complex connections may require a custom scope.</p></details></div></div><div class=\"service-related\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Keep exploring</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/services/website-design\">Website Design &amp; Development<!-- --> ↗</a><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/services/custom-business-systems\">Custom Business Systems<!-- --> ↗</a><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/services\">All services ↗</a></div></section><section id=\"service-contact\" class=\"section contact-section\"><div class=\"wrap contact-grid\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Let’s find your next step</p><h2>Start with a<br/><em>free growth review.</em></h2><p>Tell me about your business and the problem you want to solve. I’ll review your online presence or workflow and suggest a practical next step, with no obligation to buy.</p><a class=\"text-link email-link\" href=\"mailto:thesipsoftwaresolutions@gmail.com\">thesipsoftwaresolutions@gmail.com ↗</a></div><form class=\"contact-form\"><div class=\"form-row\"><label>Your name<input autoComplete=\"name\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"First and last name\" maxLength=\"120\" name=\"name\"/></label><label>Email address<input type=\"email\" autoComplete=\"email\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"you@yourbusiness.com\" maxLength=\"254\" name=\"email\"/></label></div><label>Business name<input autoComplete=\"organization\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"What’s your business called?\" maxLength=\"180\" name=\"business\"/></label><label>Service of interest<select name=\"service\"><option>Not sure — free growth review</option><option>Website Design &amp; Development</option><option selected=\"\">Business Growth System</option><option>Google Business Profile Setup &amp; Optimization</option><option>Local SEO &amp; Visibility</option><option>Lead Capture &amp; Follow-Up Setup</option><option>Review Request System</option><option>Appointment &amp; Booking Automation</option><option>Business Workflow Automation</option><option>AI Solutions for Small Businesses</option><option>Custom Business Systems</option><option>Monthly Website Care &amp; Local Growth</option><option>Hosting &amp; Website Performance</option></select></label><label>Current website (optional)<input maxLength=\"500\" placeholder=\"Your website or business profile link\" name=\"website\"/></label><label>What would you like to improve?<textarea name=\"message\" required=\"\" rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"Tell me about your services, where you work, and what you want to make easier.\" maxLength=\"3000\"></textarea></label><button class=\"button\" type=\"submit\">Draft my free review request ↗</button><p class=\"small\">This opens a draft in your email app. Send it there to complete your inquiry. You can also email me directly.</p></form></div></section><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Business Growth System\",\"description\":\"A website, local search foundation, and customer inquiry workflow for Mississippi service businesses ready to organize their next stage of growth.\",\"url\":\"https://thesipwebstudio.com/services/business-growth-system\",\"provider\":{\"@id\":\"https://thesipwebstudio.com/#studio\"},\"areaServed\":[\"Jackson, MS\",\"Madison, MS\",\"Ridgeland, MS\",\"Brandon, MS\",\"Flowood, MS\",\"Pearl, MS\",\"Clinton, MS\"]}</script></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class=\"wrap footer\"><a class=\"wordmark\" href=\"/\">the sip<span>WEB STUDIO</span></a><p>Thoughtfully built in Mississippi.<br/><a href=\"/services\">Explore services</a> · <a href=\"/services/google-business-profile#disclosure\">Google profile disclosure</a></p><p>© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> The Sip Web Studio</p></footer><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://sc